  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "儿女一句话：爸妈，孩子以后就全靠你们了。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 5200,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5200,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您要是当场一口应下，往后累了都不好意思开口；一口回绝，又怕伤了孩子的心。",
      "chars": 36,
      "speech_ms": 8240,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 5600,
      "end_ms": 13840,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "其实这事，答应不答应，先别急着表态，把四件事摆到桌面上说清：",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6760,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14240,
      "end_ms": 21000,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第一，带到几岁有个头；",
      "chars": 11,
      "speech_ms": 2510,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 21400,
      "end_ms": 23910,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二，日常接送、买菜做饭这些活怎么分工；",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4640,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 24310,
      "end_ms": 28950,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第三，孩子生病、家里有急事，谁请假、谁顶上，别全压在老人身上；",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 7760,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 29350,
      "end_ms": 37110,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第四，留出您二老自己的时间，看病、串门、跳个广场舞，那是正事不是偷懒。",
      "chars": 35,
      "speech_ms": 9220,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 37510,
      "end_ms": 46730,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "话说清了再点头，这不叫算计，叫把日子过长久。",
      "chars": 22,
      "speech_ms": 5410,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 47130,
      "end_ms": 52540,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "帮儿女带娃是情分，不是欠他们的债；把丑话说在前头，一家人反倒处得亲。",
      "chars": 34,
      "speech_ms": 7570,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 52940,
      "end_ms": 60510,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}